# Line endings: the repository is authored with LF. Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite these files to CRLF.
#
# js/data/astrologie.js is generated by scripts/generate-astrologie-data.cjs and
# is compared byte for byte against a fresh generation in tests/astrologie.mjs.
# Any end-of-line conversion would make that test fail on a Windows checkout
# while passing on Linux CI, so the file must be stored and checked out verbatim.
js/data/astrologie.js -text
